WEBVTT

00:05.310 --> 00:07.070
Yay!

00:07.070 --> 00:09.890
I always wanted to ride in one of these!

00:10.230 --> 00:13.030
You're getting too wound up, Shiek.

00:13.290 --> 00:16.530
We're on our way to 
help Cecilia, you know.

00:16.530 --> 00:19.210
You just had to tag along...

00:19.210 --> 00:22.670
What? You were gonna leave me behind?

00:24.730 --> 00:29.350
Damn it! It was supposed 
to be just me and Cecilia!

00:29.350 --> 00:33.770
I'm sorry to drag you two 
along on my business.

00:36.500 --> 00:37.310
What's wrong?

00:37.670 --> 00:41.000
I think... I'm a bit motion-sick...

00:41.420 --> 00:43.050
Should we take a break?

00:43.050 --> 00:45.060
Oh, then drink this.

00:46.140 --> 00:48.500
It's an infusion made from 
a secret pixie recipe!

00:49.530 --> 00:51.230
Thank you so much.

00:56.460 --> 00:58.950
I think I feel better.

00:59.330 --> 01:00.970
Oh, good!

01:00.970 --> 01:04.120
See? I'm pretty useful, right?

01:04.610 --> 01:06.330
G-Get off me!

01:08.780 --> 01:12.840
To be honest, I'm relieved 
that you're both with me.

01:12.840 --> 01:14.970
Sure! You can count on me!

01:15.230 --> 01:17.090
You can count on me, too!

01:17.310 --> 01:19.080
I said get off me!

01:20.940 --> 01:22.650
For crying out loud...

02:57.530 --> 03:00.690
I heard they had been 
attacked by bandits...

03:02.140 --> 03:04.370
This looks pretty bad.

03:05.340 --> 03:07.040
Well, well!

03:07.040 --> 03:11.030
I never expected Lady 
Cecilia to come to our aid.

03:11.030 --> 03:13.570
And... who are these two?

03:13.920 --> 03:16.610
My friends. They're here to help me.

03:16.610 --> 03:20.140
They're skilled at healing, 
so don't worry about a thing.

03:20.140 --> 03:20.930
Hello.

03:21.180 --> 03:24.430
Ah, that is reassuring.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.130
Thank you so much!

03:38.130 --> 03:39.860
Take care of yourself, now.

03:40.290 --> 03:44.110
Cecilia's really giving it her all.

03:45.080 --> 03:47.580
Look at her, trying her hardest.

03:50.100 --> 03:51.710
Take care.

03:51.710 --> 03:53.140
Mr. Yoki.

03:53.810 --> 03:57.320
Isn't Lady Cecilia a wonderful person?

03:57.320 --> 03:58.250
Yes.

03:58.580 --> 04:00.590
Right?! Isn't she?!

04:00.930 --> 04:06.560
Still, the fact that no one was 
killed is kind of a silver lining.

04:06.560 --> 04:11.000
Yes, the bandits suddenly turned and fled.

04:11.000 --> 04:12.150
They fled?

04:13.000 --> 04:17.620
Someone showed up out of 
nowhere and cut them down.

04:18.010 --> 04:19.700
Infighting?

04:19.700 --> 04:21.130
Next, please!

04:24.690 --> 04:25.900
Cecilia...

04:30.540 --> 04:34.910
Cecilia, maybe you should 
take a little break?

04:34.910 --> 04:37.040
No, I'm all right.

04:39.100 --> 04:40.260
Holy Bell.

04:45.430 --> 04:48.780
It's okay! She's only asleep.

04:49.260 --> 04:51.900
Do you have a place where she can rest?

04:55.940 --> 04:57.590
Ah, she's awake.

05:05.870 --> 05:09.030
You know what I'm about to say, don't you?

05:09.570 --> 05:12.700
I'm sorry I used magic to put 
you to sleep without warning.

05:12.700 --> 05:17.070
It's not right to ignore 
someone's own will.

05:17.070 --> 05:19.540
But it's not good to overdo it, either.

05:20.430 --> 05:23.720
If you'd kept healing like that, 
you would've knocked yourself out.

05:24.610 --> 05:26.470
Yes, you're right.

05:26.470 --> 05:29.470
But please don't ever do that again, okay?

05:30.450 --> 05:31.670
I promise.

05:32.180 --> 05:36.020
We finished treating the 
villagers, so don't worry.

05:36.420 --> 05:37.660
Yoki...

05:38.490 --> 05:40.480
Thank you.

05:41.790 --> 05:43.030
So cute!

05:43.400 --> 05:44.840
Aw, nah...

05:47.130 --> 05:49.010
Come on in!

05:51.650 --> 05:56.660
Ah, Lady Cecilia. Are you feeling better?

05:56.660 --> 05:59.070
I'm sorry I worried you.

05:59.070 --> 06:03.420
Not at all. I'm sorry to bring 
this up when you're exhausted,

06:03.770 --> 06:07.800
but there's a little girl named Teal 
living on the outskirts of town.

06:07.800 --> 06:10.620
Could I trouble you to take a look at her?

06:10.620 --> 06:12.430
Did the bandits hurt her, too?

06:12.430 --> 06:16.310
No, thankfully, she was not attacked.

06:16.630 --> 06:21.600
But Teal has been sickly since she was 
born, and she's always stuck in bed.

06:21.600 --> 06:23.220
I'm worried about her.

06:23.220 --> 06:24.570
Understood.

06:25.370 --> 06:27.300
Could you tell me where she is?

06:29.340 --> 06:30.940
Excuse me.

06:30.940 --> 06:32.050
Come in.

06:33.470 --> 06:35.220
Who might you be?

06:35.220 --> 06:37.670
I'm sorry to drop in unannounced.

06:37.670 --> 06:39.310
My name is Cecilia.

06:39.310 --> 06:42.550
This is Yoki, and this is Shiek.

06:42.550 --> 06:44.850
The village headman asked us to come.

06:44.850 --> 06:46.210
The headma—

06:47.850 --> 06:49.220
Shiek, you're up.

06:49.220 --> 06:49.950
Right.

06:50.950 --> 06:52.700
Take this medicine.

06:54.140 --> 06:55.710
Don't worry.

06:55.710 --> 07:00.000
Despite how he looks, 
Shiek knows his stuff.

07:00.000 --> 07:02.900
What?! Captain, what was 
that about how I look?!

07:08.760 --> 07:12.120
I think I feel a little bit better.

07:12.120 --> 07:13.380
That's great!

07:13.380 --> 07:17.910
Thank you for giving me 
this amazing medicine.

07:18.130 --> 07:21.640
This must be the guardian 
deity's divine protection.

07:21.640 --> 07:22.820
Guardian deity?

07:22.820 --> 07:24.680
You don't know him?

07:24.680 --> 07:27.420
He's the statue of the god 
on the outskirts of town!

07:27.420 --> 07:28.920
A statue of...

07:29.340 --> 07:30.420
...a god?

07:30.420 --> 07:32.110
The day the bandits came,

07:32.110 --> 07:35.540
I suddenly grew sleepy on my way 
home from taking him an offering,

07:35.540 --> 07:37.650
so I escaped their attack!

07:37.650 --> 07:39.180
Wasn't that just coincidence?

07:39.180 --> 07:43.440
That's not all! When I 
was seven years old...

07:45.070 --> 07:47.400
Just when I thought it was all over...

07:51.450 --> 07:54.690
the guardian deity saved my life!

07:56.620 --> 08:00.580
What could it be if not 
his divine protection?

08:01.140 --> 08:04.510
Intense sleepiness and black lightning?

08:04.990 --> 08:06.500
Dark magic?

08:06.500 --> 08:09.130
Yoki, this sounds a bit suspicious.

08:09.130 --> 08:10.960
It isn't suspicious at all!

08:10.960 --> 08:13.220
One look at him, and you'll understand!

08:13.220 --> 08:14.970
Uh, this is...

08:14.970 --> 08:16.220
...obviously...

08:18.200 --> 08:20.420
He's so wonderful!

08:20.420 --> 08:22.230
A demon statue?

08:22.230 --> 08:25.140
I won't allow anyone to 
belittle the guardian de—

08:27.570 --> 08:28.690
Teal!

08:29.420 --> 08:31.390
I'm sorry we pushed you so hard.

08:31.390 --> 08:33.190
Why don't I take you home?

08:38.580 --> 08:41.580
You know, it looks just like...

08:41.970 --> 08:44.750
the gargoyles in the Demon King's castle.

08:50.050 --> 08:52.840
It really is a gargoyle! Shiek!

08:52.840 --> 08:53.560
Huh?

08:53.560 --> 08:55.130
Right here!

08:58.190 --> 09:00.860
Captain, what should we do with him?

09:01.330 --> 09:02.990
Man, you're quick.

09:02.990 --> 09:04.980
Hey, can you speak?

09:04.980 --> 09:07.050
If you want to kill me, do it!

09:07.730 --> 09:09.140
'Kay!

09:09.950 --> 09:11.300
Wait, wait, wait.

09:12.070 --> 09:14.740
I just want to talk to him.

09:15.350 --> 09:18.990
You haven't come to kill me?

09:18.990 --> 09:21.940
You're the one who attacked us first.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.920
I apologize.

09:23.920 --> 09:25.970
I heard that you knew what I was,

09:25.970 --> 09:28.500
and then something about 
the Demon King's castle.

09:28.500 --> 09:30.370
We're sorry, too.

09:30.680 --> 09:34.510
But how did a gargoyle like you become 
this village's guardian deity?

09:34.510 --> 09:39.260
I was originally made to 
guard a certain temple,

09:39.500 --> 09:43.180
but long ago, I was stolen 
from it by bandits.

09:43.180 --> 09:45.620
Then they attacked this village,

09:45.620 --> 09:48.440
so I brought down divine 
punishment upon them.

09:48.710 --> 09:54.280
The villagers have been calling me 
their guardian deity ever since.

09:54.280 --> 09:57.570
Only that little girl still 
comes to see me, though.

09:57.850 --> 09:58.820
Teal?

09:59.160 --> 10:00.230
Yes.

10:00.230 --> 10:02.920
Nearly every day since I saved 
her from those monsters,

10:02.920 --> 10:05.880
she has been cleaning this 
little shrine for me.

10:06.290 --> 10:08.820
When I learned that bandits 
attacked again yesterday,

10:08.820 --> 10:11.080
I kept her safe.

10:11.310 --> 10:12.940
I see.

10:12.940 --> 10:16.470
So you don't mean the 
humans any harm, then?

10:16.470 --> 10:20.180
Not at all. I only live here.

10:20.180 --> 10:23.470
I have no intention of involving 
myself with the humans in any way.

10:23.930 --> 10:25.710
Guess there's no problem, then.

10:26.030 --> 10:28.730
Sorry to bother you. Shiek, got a sec?

10:28.730 --> 10:30.670
What is it, Captain?

10:30.670 --> 10:32.740
I need to talk to you.

10:36.810 --> 10:40.150
Going back to the inn first 
because he was sleepy...

10:40.150 --> 10:42.390
Shiek is just adorable, isn't he?

10:42.390 --> 10:44.740
He's still a kid, after all.

10:45.510 --> 10:49.550
Though the truth is that 
I sent him back myself.

10:49.550 --> 10:51.240
Now it's just the two of us!

10:51.240 --> 10:53.100
Is something the matter?

10:53.100 --> 10:55.450
Oh, no! Nothing at all!

10:56.250 --> 10:57.570
I mean, uh...

10:58.120 --> 11:01.760
I was wondering if it's okay 
to just let that gargoyle be.

11:01.760 --> 11:05.570
It does seem like a problem that 
there's a monster in the village...

11:06.270 --> 11:10.020
but he doesn't seem to be 
bothering the villagers.

11:10.020 --> 11:10.520
Yeah.

11:10.840 --> 11:13.140
Seems like he's kept to 
himself the whole time,

11:13.140 --> 11:14.560
so I think it'll be fine.

11:14.560 --> 11:17.130
Shall we put the matter on hold for now?

11:17.130 --> 11:17.900
Sure.

11:22.620 --> 11:25.240
C-Crap! What do I do?

11:25.570 --> 11:27.330
I'm out of stuff to talk about!

11:35.020 --> 11:35.950
Cecilia!

11:45.330 --> 11:48.100
Er, um... watch your step.

11:48.100 --> 11:49.220
R-Right!

11:49.580 --> 11:51.750
Walking around at night 
is dangerous, y'know.

11:52.980 --> 11:53.730
Yeah...

11:54.920 --> 11:56.860
Thank you.

12:09.090 --> 12:11.120
It's the bandits!

12:13.370 --> 12:16.630
Take all the money and food you can find!

12:16.630 --> 12:18.040
Stop right there.

12:18.630 --> 12:20.840
We will not allow any further evil acts!

12:20.840 --> 12:22.590
Who the hell are you brats?

12:22.860 --> 12:24.340
You're up, Shiek.

12:25.470 --> 12:27.680
Okay, here I go.

12:28.050 --> 12:29.060
What?!

12:31.020 --> 12:32.480
You little...

12:34.690 --> 12:36.440
He's strong...

12:36.440 --> 12:38.950
He isn't my subordinate for nothing.

12:38.950 --> 12:41.590
Well, I'd better get 
in on this fight, too.

12:41.590 --> 12:42.820
I'll back you up.

12:43.100 --> 12:44.570
Storm Blow!

12:47.280 --> 12:49.030
Who's next?

12:52.090 --> 12:54.740
Yoki! You saved me!

12:54.740 --> 12:56.050
Not a problem.

12:57.930 --> 12:58.890
Is that...

12:58.890 --> 13:00.500
From the guardian deity's shrine?

13:01.190 --> 13:03.090
Shiek, head over there.

13:03.610 --> 13:04.590
Got it!

13:05.960 --> 13:07.340
Get over yourselves!

13:07.340 --> 13:10.350
You think two little 
brats can take us alone?!

13:11.000 --> 13:13.850
I could handle the likes of you by myself.

13:14.900 --> 13:15.980
Here I go.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.730
Hyper Storm!

13:23.020 --> 13:24.490
Well, they're taken care of.

13:25.260 --> 13:27.510
Shiek isn't back yet?

13:27.510 --> 13:29.990
It would seem not.

13:29.990 --> 13:32.490
Guardian deity! Hang in there!

13:42.440 --> 13:43.760
Shiek!

13:44.010 --> 13:47.470
Ah. The celebrity appears at last.

13:48.770 --> 13:50.970
Who the hell is he?

13:51.220 --> 13:54.670
He's Miller, the hero 
of the Gallis Empire!

13:54.670 --> 13:58.480
A hero? There are other 
ones besides yours?

13:58.480 --> 14:02.230
Th-The battle's not over yet...

14:02.230 --> 14:05.030
Shiek, don't push yourself too hard.

14:05.430 --> 14:06.950
What happened?

14:06.950 --> 14:12.950
He came up from behind while the 
gargoyle was protecting Teal, and...

14:13.230 --> 14:16.450
I... tried to protect them, but...

14:16.450 --> 14:17.460
You piece of...

14:17.730 --> 14:21.460
What kind of moron defends a gargoyle?

14:22.870 --> 14:23.960
Hold it!

14:24.450 --> 14:27.470
What? Don't we need to kill the monster?

14:27.470 --> 14:31.490
Stop. He's only protecting Teal.

14:31.490 --> 14:34.930
Then I'll slice the brat 
in two along with him.

14:34.930 --> 14:35.930
Like hell you will!

14:39.420 --> 14:41.310
My magic was erased?!

14:41.310 --> 14:43.640
You can't! Please, fall back!

14:43.640 --> 14:46.090
You're no match for him!

14:46.460 --> 14:50.210
His weapon is a man-made 
magic sword called Magic Eater.

14:50.210 --> 14:52.410
It absorbs magic!

14:52.410 --> 14:55.760
You heard her. So back off!

14:57.730 --> 14:59.040
Guardian deity!

14:59.910 --> 15:01.450
Please stop this!

15:01.450 --> 15:04.670
If you harm a citizen of 
Clariness, it'll lead to war!

15:04.890 --> 15:08.570
War sounds great. I'd love that.

15:10.590 --> 15:15.420
I can hardly enjoy killing when 
the world's at peace, can I?

15:15.420 --> 15:17.880
But in a war, I can kill all I want.

15:17.880 --> 15:20.120
Isn't that right, my good lady?

15:20.580 --> 15:24.110
You have no pride as a hero, do you?

15:26.570 --> 15:28.610
We can't let this guy go free.

15:28.610 --> 15:30.860
Magic won't work on me, you know.

15:31.780 --> 15:33.620
Are you sure?

15:34.990 --> 15:37.620
Pretty pathetic, for all your bluster.

15:37.620 --> 15:40.120
This is just a little greeting.

15:46.590 --> 15:51.290
I told you, magic won't work on me!

15:51.290 --> 15:53.760
Why don't you try using a weapon?

15:53.760 --> 15:56.760
Unfortunately, magic is all I can use.

15:56.760 --> 15:58.390
Idiot!

16:02.410 --> 16:03.700
Not enough!

16:04.060 --> 16:06.190
It's no use! No use! No use!

16:06.190 --> 16:07.530
This is bad.

16:07.530 --> 16:10.690
If the boy uses up all his magic, he'll 
be up against the wall instantly.

16:10.690 --> 16:11.700
Yoki!

16:11.700 --> 16:13.940
Okay, then, how about this?

16:13.940 --> 16:14.700
Oh?

16:16.440 --> 16:19.200
Blazing Plasma!

16:25.900 --> 16:27.550
He's so powerful...

16:27.550 --> 16:31.460
It can't be... Even the highest-ranking 
magic doesn't work.

16:31.460 --> 16:34.220
Is that all you know how to do?

16:34.220 --> 16:36.970
I'm just about to get serious.

16:42.980 --> 16:45.180
Go on, keep flailing!

16:45.180 --> 16:47.730
Your magic capacity is 
impressive for a human,

16:47.730 --> 16:50.730
but the moment it runs out, you're dead!

16:51.750 --> 16:52.490
No!

16:55.100 --> 16:58.250
That might have worked 
on anyone else but me!

17:00.490 --> 17:03.290
It's just a man-made magic sword.

17:03.290 --> 17:07.000
Looks like there's only 
so much it can absorb.

17:07.250 --> 17:09.250
This is the end of you.

17:11.910 --> 17:13.760
Just how much magic do you have?!

17:19.510 --> 17:21.510
Storm Blow!

17:27.830 --> 17:31.080
Angering me was a big mistake!

17:31.080 --> 17:34.440
This is as far as your 
arrogance will take you!

17:38.990 --> 17:40.470
Die!

17:42.330 --> 17:43.580
No!

17:45.950 --> 17:47.230
What are you—

17:47.620 --> 17:50.340
Thank goodness... I kept you safe...

17:51.310 --> 17:52.460
Teal!

17:57.310 --> 17:59.720
Well, that was pretty fun.

17:59.720 --> 18:04.720
Getting yourself killed to defend 
a demon was just brilliant!

18:05.340 --> 18:08.230
Shut up. I won't let 
you get away with this.

18:09.160 --> 18:13.610
You sure? They're all gonna 
die if you don't protect them!

18:16.610 --> 18:17.360
Damn it!

18:24.300 --> 18:25.620
He got away.

18:28.500 --> 18:29.930
I'm a fool!

18:29.930 --> 18:34.130
I let myself think everything would work 
out as long as I had overpowered magic!

18:57.070 --> 18:59.240
What is... that form?

19:03.260 --> 19:04.620
Yoki...

19:16.610 --> 19:17.630
A demon?

19:17.630 --> 19:20.690
Perfect timing. I'm 
really pissed right now.

19:20.690 --> 19:22.510
A demon hunt sounds like fun.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.570
What?!

19:27.140 --> 19:30.140
Damn it! What the hell are you?!

19:30.140 --> 19:33.650
You robbed one of my men 
of his arm and wings.

19:34.030 --> 19:37.150
Your many evil deeds 
warrant certain death.

19:37.150 --> 19:40.210
Tsk! You're that gargoyle's master, huh?

19:54.030 --> 19:55.980
The Demon King was defeated!

19:55.980 --> 19:58.650
How is there still such 
a powerful demon around?!

19:58.650 --> 19:59.880
I'm not done.

19:59.880 --> 20:02.450
Die, damn you!

20:14.770 --> 20:17.150
What are you gonna do to m—

20:21.540 --> 20:25.160
I get it. Killing is 
so much fun, isn't it?

20:28.860 --> 20:29.830
Yoki...

20:32.610 --> 20:35.170
You are not worth killing.

20:38.830 --> 20:41.300
If you're lucky, you might make 
it back to your country.

20:42.040 --> 20:43.140
Screw you!

20:43.140 --> 20:46.890
You're gonna regret 
humiliating me like this!

20:58.120 --> 20:59.190
Yoki!

21:01.300 --> 21:02.320
How's everyone?

21:03.400 --> 21:06.320
They're all safe and sleeping.

21:06.830 --> 21:08.600
Oh, good.

21:09.290 --> 21:10.150
You're bleeding!

21:10.460 --> 21:12.710
Oh, this? I'm fine.

21:12.710 --> 21:14.710
I just ripped out my own horns.

21:14.710 --> 21:17.210
You're not fine at all!

21:21.100 --> 21:22.710
Welcome back.

21:23.790 --> 21:24.810
Thanks.

21:26.890 --> 21:28.720
You want to go to Minerva?

21:29.290 --> 21:30.470
Please!

21:30.470 --> 21:33.960
I want to look for a way to heal 
the guardian deity's wounds!

21:34.740 --> 21:37.650
Healing magic can't 
heal wounds like these.

21:37.650 --> 21:38.980
But maybe in Minerva...

21:38.980 --> 21:43.310
That's true, but monsters 
can't enter Minerva.

21:43.310 --> 21:46.110
In that case, I have a good idea.

21:46.620 --> 21:48.510
I changed his appearance with earth magic!

21:48.510 --> 21:50.600
Now he doesn't look like a monster!

21:50.600 --> 21:52.370
T-True...

21:57.870 --> 22:02.280
Anyone recommended by Cecilia is 
welcome to work in this mansion.

22:02.280 --> 22:03.760
I'm good at cleaning!

22:04.350 --> 22:08.130
I'd also like to put this 
statue in the mansion.

22:08.130 --> 22:09.090
No.

22:09.090 --> 22:10.010
Aww!

22:10.360 --> 22:13.220
I can't put something with 
such poor taste in this house.

22:13.220 --> 22:14.520
Take it back.

22:14.890 --> 22:16.770
B-But...

22:17.130 --> 22:21.480
The guardian deity!
